CEF:0|Microsoft|Microsoft Windows||Microsoft-Windows-Security-Auditing:4769|A Kerberos service ticket was requested.|Low| eventId=12752 externalId=4769 msg=This event is generated every time access is requested to a resource such as a computer or a Windows service.  The service name indicates the resource to which access was requested.This event can be correlated with Windows logon events by comparing the Logon GUID fields in each event.  The logon event occurs on the machine that was accessed, which is often a different machine than the domain controller which issued the service ticket.Ticket options, encryption types, and failure codes are defined in RFC 4120. categorySignificance=/Informational categoryBehavior=/Authentication/Verify categoryDeviceGroup=/Operating System catdt=Operating System categoryOutcome=/Success categoryObject=/Host/Operating System art=1510994120411 cat=Security deviceSeverity=Audit_success rt=1510994118000 shost=DB src=10.100.1.104 sourceZoneURI=/All Zones/ArcSight System/Private Address Space Zones/RFC1918: 10.0.0.0-10.255.255.255 spt=2827 dhost=DC.edpcg.local dst=10.100.1.100 destinationZoneURI=/All Zones/ArcSight System/Private Address Space Zones/RFC1918: 10.0.0.0-10.255.255.255 dntdom=EDPCG.LOCAL duser=DB$@EDPCG.LOCAL destinationServiceName=DC$ cs2=Account Logon:Kerberos Ticket Events cs4=0x0 cs6={171C3457-655E-371B-1F77-B2885FB08FDC} c6a4=fe80:0:0:0:394f:9ac6:d87a:ff8a cs1Label=Accesses cs2Label=EventlogCategory cs4Label=Reason or Error Code cs5Label=Authentication Package Name cs6Label=Logon GUID cn1Label=LogonType cn2Label=CrashOnAuditFail cn3Label=Count c6a2Label=Source IPv6 Address c6a4Label=Agent IPv6 Address ahost=COLECT.edpcg.local agt=10.100.1.106 agentZoneURI=/All Zones/ArcSight System/Private Address Space Zones/RFC1918: 10.0.0.0-10.255.255.255 av=7.0.5.7132.0 atz=Europe/London aid=3daZ8yl8BABCHJ8gkklA3kA\=\= at=windowsfg dvchost=DC.edpcg.local dvc=10.100.1.100 deviceZoneURI=/All Zones/ArcSight System/Private Address Space Zones/RFC1918: 10.0.0.0-10.255.255.255 dtz=Europe/London _cefVer=0.1 ad.Service_,Information:Service_,ID=S-1-5-21-2993915768-915369290-59681569-1000 ad.Additional_,Inc1+cZg_~_~sited_,Services=- ad.Additional_,InMbHgGQ_~_~Ticket_,Options=0x40810000 ad.WindowsKeyMapFamily=Windows 2008 R2 ad.EventIndex=3378099 ad.Additional_,InagWMqg_~_~ncryption_,Type=0x17 ad.WindowsParserFamily=Windows 2008 R2|2008|7|Vista ad.WindowsVersion=Windows Server 2008 R2
CEF:0|Microsoft|Microsoft Windows||Microsoft-Windows-Security-Auditing:4769|A Kerberos service ticket was requested.|Low| eventId=12753 externalId=4769 msg=This event is generated every time access is requested to a resource such as a computer or a Windows service.  The service name indicates the resource to which access was requested.This event can be correlated with Windows logon events by comparing the Logon GUID fields in each event.  The logon event occurs on the machine that was accessed, which is often a different machine than the domain controller which issued the service ticket.Ticket options, encryption types, and failure codes are defined in RFC 4120. categorySignificance=/Informational categoryBehavior=/Authentication/Verify categoryDeviceGroup=/Operating System catdt=Operating System categoryOutcome=/Success categoryObject=/Host/Operating System art=1510994120411 cat=Security deviceSeverity=Audit_success rt=1510994118000 shost=DB src=10.100.1.104 sourceZoneURI=/All Zones/ArcSight System/Private Address Space Zones/RFC1918: 10.0.0.0-10.255.255.255 spt=2828 dhost=DC.edpcg.local dst=10.100.1.100 destinationZoneURI=/All Zones/ArcSight System/Private Address Space Zones/RFC1918: 10.0.0.0-10.255.255.255 dntdom=EDPCG.LOCAL duser=DB$@EDPCG.LOCAL destinationServiceName=krbtgt cs2=Account Logon:Kerberos Ticket Events cs4=0x0 cs6={171C3457-655E-371B-1F77-B2885FB08FDC} c6a4=fe80:0:0:0:394f:9ac6:d87a:ff8a cs1Label=Accesses cs2Label=EventlogCategory cs4Label=Reason or Error Code cs5Label=Authentication Package Name cs6Label=Logon GUID cn1Label=LogonType cn2Label=CrashOnAuditFail cn3Label=Count c6a2Label=Source IPv6 Address c6a4Label=Agent IPv6 Address ahost=COLECT.edpcg.local agt=10.100.1.106 agentZoneURI=/All Zones/ArcSight System/Private Address Space Zones/RFC1918: 10.0.0.0-10.255.255.255 av=7.0.5.7132.0 atz=Europe/London aid=3daZ8yl8BABCHJ8gkklA3kA\=\= at=windowsfg dvchost=DC.edpcg.local dvc=10.100.1.100 deviceZoneURI=/All Zones/ArcSight System/Private Address Sp